+
+  <p style="font-size:14px;color:#9CA3AF;letter-spacing:2px;margin:0 0 18px;"><span leaf="">小吴聊 · 商业观察 · 2026-08-16</span></p>
+  <h1 style="font-size:27px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:900;margin:0 0 22px;color:#1C1917;"><span leaf="">140亿参数的世界模型，能连续记路2小时</span></h1>
+  <p style="font-size:14px;color:#6B7280;border-left:4px solid #DC2626;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 30px;"><span leaf="">更快（3 步去噪）反而更稳，记忆被搬到了模型外面。</span></p>
+
+  <p><span leaf="">8月12日，Alaya Lab 把 EVOKE 的论文、权重和演示一起放了出来。一句话：这是一个 140 亿参数的交互世界模型，用 3 步去噪生成视频，官方称在 WBench 上拿下 SOTA，还能连续跑 2 小时不崩。</span></p>
+  <p><span leaf="">我把论文、项目主页和 GitHub 仓库翻了一遍。这次值得关注的，是它第一次把记忆放在了模型外面。</span></p>
+
+  <section style="padding:0 0 32px;">
+    <p style="font-size:14px;color:#9CA3AF;margin:0 0 14px;letter-spacing:1px;"><span leaf="">📌 本文看点</span></p>
+    <section style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;">
+      <section style="flex:1;background:#FEF2F2;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 10px;margin-right:8px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #FEE2E2;">
+        <p style="display:inline-block;background:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;margin:0 0 8px;"><span leaf="">01</span></p>
+        <p style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#1C1917;margin:0;"><span leaf="">快与省的账</span></p>
+      </section>
+      <section style="flex:1;background:#FEF2F2;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 10px;margin-right:8px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #FEE2E2;">
+        <p style="display:inline-block;background:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;margin:0 0 8px;"><span leaf="">02</span></p>
+        <p style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#1C1917;margin:0;"><span leaf="">记忆为什么难</span></p>
+      </section>
+      <section style="flex:1;background:#FEF2F2;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 10px;text-align:center;border:1px solid #FEE2E2;">
+        <p style="display:inline-block;background:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:4px;margin:0 0 8px;"><span leaf="">03</span></p>
+        <p style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#1C1917;margin:0;"><span leaf="">行动判断</span></p>
+      </section>
+    </section>
+  </section>
+
+  <section style="margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:28px;padding:0;">
+    <section style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:20px;padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom:3px solid #DC2626;">
+      <section style="display:flex;align-items:center;">
+        <span style="display:inline-block;background:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;font-weight:900;padding:4px 14px;border-radius:6px;margin-right:14px;line-height:1.3;"><span leaf="">01</span></span>
+        <section>
+          <p style="font-size:10px;color:#DC2626;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 2px;"><span leaf="">LEDGER</span></p>
+          <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1C1917;margin:0;"><span leaf="">账本：快与省的账怎么算</span></h3>
+        </section>
+      </section>
+    </section>
+
+    <p style="margin-bottom:20px;"><span leaf="">单张 H200，384×640、24fps，每 1.5 秒的视频分块耗时 2.11 秒。传统做法要 50 步去噪加 CFG，EVOKE 只用 3 步、零 CFG，一次前向推理出一个分块。交互式生成的算力账，从跑不起变成了单卡可试。</span></p>
+
+    <section data-viz="table" style="margin:24px 0;background:#fff;border:1px solid #F3E2E2;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;">
+      <section style="padding:14px 18px;background:#FEF2F2;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#1C1917;"><span leaf="">EVOKE 关键规格（官方口径）</span></section>
+      <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px;">
+        <tr style="background:#FAFAFA;">
+          <td style="padding:9px 8px;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;width:34%;"><span leaf="">项目</span></td>
+          <td style="padding:9px 8px;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;width:66%;"><span leaf="">数值</span></td>
+        </tr>
+        <tr style="border-top:1px solid #F5F5F5;">
+          <td style="padding:9px 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#6B7280;"><span leaf="">参数量</span></td>
+          <td style="padding:9px 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#1C1917;"><span leaf="">140 亿（14B）</span></td>
+        </tr>
+        <tr style="border-top:1px solid #F5F5F5;">
+          <td style="padding:9px 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#6B7280;"><span leaf="">去噪步数</span></td>
+          <td style="padding:9px 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#DC2626;font-weight:800;"><span leaf="">3 步，零 CFG</span></td>
+        </tr>
+        <tr style="border-top:1px solid #F5F5F5;">
+          <td style="padding:9px 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#6B7280;"><span leaf="">生成速度</span></td>
+          <td style="padding:9px 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#1C1917;"><span leaf="">1.5 秒分块 / 2.11 秒（单张 H200）</span></td>
+        </tr>
+        <tr style="border-top:1px solid #F5F5F5;">
+          <td style="padding:9px 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#6B7280;"><span leaf="">记忆窗口</span></td>
+          <td style="padding:9px 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#1C1917;"><span leaf="">约 90 秒（外部世界状态库）</span></td>
+        </tr>
+        <tr style="border-top:1px solid #F5F5F5;">
+          <td style="padding:9px 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#6B7280;"><span leaf="">连续会话</span></td>
+          <td style="padding:9px 8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#DC2626;font-weight:800;"><span leaf="">小时级实测，演示含 2 小时</span></td>
+        </tr>
+      </table>
+      <section style="padding:12px 18px 14px;font-size:12px;color:#9CA3AF;border-top:1px dashed #F3E2E2;margin-top:12px;"><span leaf="">数据来源：GitHub AlayaLab/Evoke / 官方项目主页（2026-08）</span></section>
+    </section>
+
+    <p><span leaf="">开源账同样值得算：GitHub 仓库 Apache-2.0，4 个模型加教师权重全部放出。要提醒的是深度后端 ViGeo 是 CC-BY-NC-4.0，商用前要把许可证逐条核对。</span></p>
+  </section>
+
+  <section style="padding:0 10px;">
+    <section style="height:1px;background:linear-gradient(to right,transparent,#FCA5A5,#DC2626,#FCA5A5,transparent);margin:0;"><span leaf=""><br></span></section>
+  </section>
+
+  <section style="margin-top:48px;margin-bottom:28px;padding:0 10px;">
+    <section style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:20px;padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom:3px solid #DC2626;">
+      <section style="display:flex;align-items:center;">
+        <span style="display:inline-block;background:#DC2626;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;font-weight:900;padding:4px 14px;border-radius:6px;margin-right:14px;line-height:1.3;"><span leaf="">02</span></span>
+        <section>
+          <p style="font-size:10px;color:#DC2626;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;margin:0 0 2px;"><span leaf="">MECHANISM</span></p>
+          <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1C1917;margin:0;"><span leaf="">机制解剖：为什么记住这么难</span></h3>
+        </section>
+      </section>
+    </section>
+
+    <p><span leaf="">长视频世界模型最大的坑是上下文：把历史帧塞进 denoiser 的上下文或 KV cache，会话越长，每次生成越贵；窗口化又会让模型忘事。EVOKE 的解法是外部化：用单目深度估计把生成的分块变成相机坐标下的点云，存进世界状态库；生成新一帧时只取当前视角要用的几何。默认 90 秒的保留窗口，会话再长，模型内部上下文保持有界。</span></p>
+    <p><span leaf="">记忆之外，它还把教师模型重做了一遍：chunk 分组稀疏注意力加远端帧检索，让 30 秒的自强制 rollout 成本可控，再把长程能力蒸馏到 3 步学生。效果在数字上很直白：镜头离开再回来，场景重建 PSNR 提升 2.3~3.2 dB；中途改提示词 67% 能生效；已经生成过的区域想覆盖，成功率掉到 4%。</span></p>
